'''Chaotic Might''' is a [[buff]] that grants 30% of [[physical damage]] [[gained as]] extra [[chaos damage]].

==Mechanics==
The effect of Chaotic Might is affected by increased [[buff effect]]. The buff duration can be indirectly scaled by  changing the buff [[expiration rate]].

==Unique items==
The following [[unique item]]s grant Chaotic Might:
{{Drop enabled unique item table
|tables=item_stats
|join=items._pageID=item_stats._pageID
|where= item_stats.id like "%old_unholy_Might%"
        OR items.stat_text like "%Chaotic_Might%"
|large=1
|base_item=1
|level=1
|stat=1
}}
==Passive skills==
{{Query passive skills
|where=
     passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%Chaotic_Might%"
}}

==Version history==
The bonuses granted by Chaotic Might were previously given by {{stl|Unholy Might}} prior to [[Version 3.24.0]]. {{il|Extractor Mentis}} was the only source of Unholy Might that was changed to grant Chaotic Might instead.

{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.24.0|
* Introduced to the game.
* The [[Unholy Might]] buff no longer grants 30% of Physical Damage as extra Chaos Damage. It instead now provides 100% of Physical Damage Converted to Chaos Damage, and 25% chance to Apply Wither on Hit.
}}
{{Version history table end}}

